PROGRAM – 4

TITLE: Build and Run a Java Application with Maven and Migrate the Same Application to Gradle

AIM:
To build a Java application using Maven and migrate it to Gradle.

PROCEDURE:

1. Create a Maven project as in Program-2.

2. Build and run the Maven project to get "Hello World!" output.

3. Open Terminal (Ctrl + Alt + Shift + T).

4. Execute:

   gradle init

5. When prompted for migration from Maven to Gradle, select:

   yes

6. Select Build Script DSL:

   Groovy

7. Accept API Generator option by selecting:

   yes

8. Build the Gradle project:

   gradle build

9. Update build.gradle file if required.

10. Run the following commands:

gradle clean build

gradle run

COMMANDS:

```text
gradle init
gradle build
gradle clean build
gradle run
```

OUTPUT:

```text
Hello World! Welcome to pgm4
```

RESULT:
Successfully migrated a Maven project to Gradle and executed the application successfully.
